            <article class="productView-description c-b">
                    <ul class="tabs" data-tab>
        <li class="tab is-active">
            <a class="tab-title" href="#tab-description">Description</a>
        </li>
</ul>
<div class="tabs-contents m-0">
        <div class="tab-content b-r-24" id="tab-description">
            <div class="toggle-title">
                <a class="toggleLink is-open" data-collapsible href="#tab-description-mobile">
                    <span class="text">Description</span>
                    <span class="icon-plus">&nbsp;</span>
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="toggle-content is-open" id="tab-description-mobile">
                <p><span style="font-size: 18pt; color: #003366;"><strong>Cisco C9300X-24Y-E Catalyst 9300X Series 24x 25GB SFP28 &nbsp; C9300 Expantion Mod Slot Switch</strong></span></p>
<p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="color: #99cc00;">C9300X-24Y-E-New Overview</span></p>
<p><span>The Cisco Catalyst 9300 Series switches are Cisco&rsquo;s lead stackable enterprise switching platform built for security, IoT, mobility, and cloud. The Catalyst 9300 Series is the first optimized platform for high-density Wi-Fi 6 and 802.11ac Wave2. It sets new maximums for network scale. These switches are also ready for the future, with an x86 CPU architecture and more memory, enabling them to host containers and run third-party applications and scripts natively within the switch. The Catalyst 9300 Series is designed for Cisco StackWise technology, providing flexible deployment with support for nonstop forwarding with Stateful Switchover (NSF/SSO), for the most resilient architecture in a stackable (sub-50-ms) solution. The highly resilient and efficient power architecture features Cisco StackPower, which delivers high-density Power over Ethernet Plus (PoE+), 60W Cisco Universal Power over Ethernet (Cisco UPOE) and 90W Cisco UPOE&reg;+ ports.</span></p>
<div style="float: left; width: 100%; margin-top: 40px;">
<p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="color: #99cc00;">Quick spec of C9300X-24Y-E-New</span></p>
<ul style="float: left; width: 100%; padding-left: 5px;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Product Code </strong>: C9300X-24Y-E</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Product Description </strong>: Catalyst 9300 24-port 25G/10G/1G SFP28 with modular uplinks, Network Essentials</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Device Type </strong>: Switch - 24 ports - L3 - managed - stackable</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Enclosure Type </strong>: Rack-mountable 1U</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Subtype </strong>: 25 Gigabit Ethernet</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Ports </strong>: 24 x 1/10/25 Gigabit SFP28</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> RAM </strong>: 16 GB</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Flash Memory </strong>: 16 GB</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Interfaces </strong>: 24 x 1/10/25GBase-X SFP28</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="float: left; width: 100%; margin-top: 15px;">
<p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="color: #99cc00;">C9300X-24Y-E-New Specification</span></p>
<ul style="float: left; width: 100%; padding-left: 5px;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Product Code </strong>:C9300X-24Y-E</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Description </strong>:Catalyst 9300 24-port 25G/10G/1G SFP28 with modular uplinks, Network Essentials</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Device Type </strong>:Switch - 24 ports - L3 - managed - stackable</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Enclosure Type </strong>:Rack-mountable 1U</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Subtype </strong>:25 Gigabit Ethernet</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Ports </strong>:24 x 1/10/25 Gigabit SFP28</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Performance </strong>:Switching capacity: 2000 Gbps &brvbar; Switching capacity with stacking: 3000 Gbps &brvbar; Forwarding rate: 1488 Mpps &brvbar; Forwarding rate with stacking: 2232 Mpps</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Capacity </strong>:IPv4 routing table entries: 39000 &brvbar; Flexible NetFlow entries: 128000 &brvbar; Direct IPv4 routes: 24000 &brvbar; Indirect IPv4 routes: 15000 &brvbar; IPv6 routing table entries: 19500 &brvbar; VLAN IDs: 4094 &brvbar; Switched virtual interfaces (SVIs): 1000 &brvbar; Multicast routing flow table: 8000 &brvbar; QoS scale entries: 4000 &brvbar; ACL scale entries: 5000 &brvbar; PVST instances: 300 &brvbar; STP Virtual Ports for PVST: 13000 &brvbar; STP Virtual Ports for MST: 13000 &brvbar; Routed ports: 448</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> MAC Address Table Size </strong>:32000 entries</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Jumbo Frame Support </strong>:9198 bytes</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Routing Protocol </strong>:OSPF, IS-IS, RIP-1, RIP-2, IGMP, VRRP, PIM-SM, OSPFv3, PIM-SSM, policy-based routing (PBR), RIPng</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Remote Management Protocol </strong>:SNMP 1, RMON 1, RMON 2, SNMP 3, SNMP 2c, CLI, NETCONF, RESTCONF</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Encryption Algorithm </strong>:256-bit AES</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Features </strong>:DHCP support, trunking, Syslog support, full duplex mode, Stateful switchover (SSO), Class-Based Weighted Fair Queuing (CBWFQ), Weighted Random Early Detection (WRED), Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) support, Access Control List (ACL) support, Quality of Service (QoS), Non-Stop Routing (NSR), Remote Switch Port Analyzer (RSPAN), Management Information Base (MIB), Cisco StackWise-480 technology, Cisco StackPower technology, Flexible NetFlow (FNF), Multicast Source Discovery Protocol (MSDP), 802.1x authentication, 16MB packet buffer, FTP client, MACsec support, 3 fans, Control plane protection (CoPP), Virtual Extensible LAN (VXLAN), Application Visibility and Control (AVC), Source-Specific Multicast (SSM), integrated Wireshark, VLAN Double Tagging (Q-in-Q), Ethernet over MPLS (EoMPLS), Hierarchical Virtual Private LAN Service (H-VPLS), Private VLAN, Layer 3 VPN (L3VPN) support, Encapsulated Remote SPAN (ERSPAN), Security Group Tag (SGT) caching, Security Group Access Control List (SGACL), IT Service Management (ITSM) integration, third-party IP Address Management (IPAM) integration, Cisco StackWise-1T technology</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Compliant Standards </strong>:IEEE 802.3, IEEE 802.3u, IEEE 802.1D, IEEE 802.1Q, IEEE 802.3ab, IEEE 802.1p, IEEE 802.3af, IEEE 802.3x, IEEE 802.3ad (LACP), IEEE 802.1w, IEEE 802.1x, IEEE 802.1s, IEEE 802.3at</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> RAM </strong>:16 GB</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Flash Memory </strong>:16 GB</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Status Indicators </strong>:Status</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Interfaces </strong>:24 x 1/10/25GBase-X SFP28 &brvbar; 1 x USB 2.0</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Expansion Slots </strong>:1 (total) / 1 (free) x expansion slot</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Power Device </strong>:Internal power supply</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Power Provided </strong>:715 Watt</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Voltage Required </strong>:AC 120/230 V (50/60 Hz)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Compliant Standards </strong>:CISPR 22 Class A, CISPR 24, EN 61000-3-2, EN 61000-3-3, EN55024, EN50082-1, EN 61000-6-1, EN 61000-4-4, EN 61000-4-2, EN 61000-4-3, EN 61000-4-6, CCC, ICES-003 Class A, EN 61000-4-5, UL 60950-1, IEC 60950-1, EN 60950-1, RoHS, AS/NZS 3548 Class A, BSMI Class A, VCCI Class A, EN 55022 Class A, FCC CFR47 Part 15 A, EN 300 386, TVCN 7317, VCCI V-3/2009 Class A, CAN/CSA-C22.2 No. 60950-1</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Width </strong>:17.5 in</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Depth </strong>:17.6 in</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Height </strong>:1.7 in</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Service &amp; Support </strong>:Limited warranty - replacement - lifetime - response time: next business day &brvbar; Technical support - consulting - 90 days</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Min Operating Temperature </strong>:23 &deg;F</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Max Operating Temperature </strong>:113 &deg;F</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Humidity Range Operating </strong>:5 - 90% (non-condensing)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Min Storage Temperature </strong>:-40 &deg;F</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Max Storage Temperature </strong>:158 &deg;F</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong> Humidity Range Storage </strong>:5 - 90% (non-condensing)</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p><a href="https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-e692hdujm7/content/yst-media/5969/c9300x-24y-e-datasheet.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #99cc00;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt;">Datasheet</span></strong></span></a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
